      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The reason I really want the option is i suffer from the side effects of having infantile spasms when I was 2. But after taking meds to cure them I still have issues. Visual overstimulation causes a fight or flight response. This is why I block audiolink, and want to block post processing completely. There is a noticeable connection for me between post processing as a whole and triggering the issue. Not just bloom. Turning it off with mods helped a lot in reducing time between triggering the response. This is an accessibility feature for me even if worlds look wrong or ugly. I just want to enjoy the game.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
