      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If they were able to implement the current bloom slider I'd like to see them go the rest of the way and put a post processing toggle in for sure. There has never been a single occasion where I've liked post processing in any given map, sometimes it's actually very uncomfortable and causes eye strain. Many world creators don't take the time to put a toggle button anywhere. \nDefault lighting is perfectly fine. I hope they do this.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
