      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Another purpose for this feature would be for ensuring that screen space shaders meant for locally communicating data such as depth textures with other programs through screen capture would not be broken in a majority of trending worlds (since post-processing in them normally causes these displayed textures to also be affected.)",
