      "value": "Please. I have damaged rod cells in my eyes making worlds with darker post processing borderline unmanagable and its the reason I've basically not touched vrchat in over a year. I keep checking back every now and then hoping to get even the most basic support for my disability and over a year later I see that I have not been listened to. :3",
